    "created_at": "2022-11-27T01:21:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-11-28T23:42:20Z",
    "body": "My Workaround:\r\n1. sideload daily build iSH.ipa from https://github.com/ish-app/ish/releases (I checked with [Build 434](https://github.com/ish-app/ish/releases/tag/builds%2F434)), latest version from AppStore will not work (\"Illegal instructions\")\r\n1. run `apk add curl shadow bash`\r\n1. run `passwd` to set password\r\n1. run `chsh -s $(which bash)`\r\n1. run `exit`\r\n1. run `echo $SHELL` to make sure if shell is bash\r\n1. run `curl -sS https://starship.rs/install.sh | sh`\r\n1. setup contents:\r\n```bash\r\n# ~/.bash_profile\r\nif [ -f ~/.bashrc ]; then\r\n\t. ~/.bashrc\r\nfi\r\n```\r\n```bash\r\n$ curl -fsSO https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marioBonales/1637696/raw/93a33aa5f1893f46773483250214f8b8b496a270/.bashrc\r\n$ echo -e \"\\nsource ~/.starship_init\\n\" >> ~/.bashrc\r\n$ starship init bash --print-full-init > ~/.starship_init\r\n```\r\n> **Note**\r\n> `cat /dev/clipboard > ~/[file name here]` is useful.\n\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/59691627/204403790-2c0a7552-9a9f-466b-99b5-b319c7725a5e.jpeg)",
